From 689fe209f8102a588ebac1bc59cf04289137a3ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kaiyuew <kaiyuew@kaiyuews-MacBook-Air.local>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:38:02 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Wait for all finalization record reads before shutdown

A fast coordinator rank could shut down after reading records while a slower peer was still fetching them. Add a read-completion rendezvous before shutdown, matching the existing compile identity exchange ordering.

A four-thread fake coordinator reproduces the prior failure and passes with the correction. The new regression and nine affected exit-hook checks pass; actual multi-host JAX behavior remains unqualified.
---
