 .../src/levanter/distributed_finalization.py  |   4 +
 .../check_read_ack_integration.py             | 107 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 112 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 lib/levanter/tests/shutdown_candidate_checks/check_read_ack_integration.py

